# Written into `public/` by the discovery and search-index Vite plugins on every
# build (see `site-kit/build/`). The generators are the source of truth — these
# outputs must never be committed, or a stale sitemap ships.
public/robots.txt
public/sitemap.xml
public/search-index.json

# Playwright output.
e2e/test-results/
playwright-report/

# `node_modules`, `dist` and `*.tsbuildinfo` are already covered by the
# repository-root .gitignore, which matches them at any depth.
